54	// The motivating collision: a genuinely frozen, setup-bearing circuit named
55	// "电路\xef\xbf\xbd" ("电路�") exists, and a job saved its circuit with
56	// bytes encoding/json repairs onto exactly that name. Even though the
57	// repaired name exists, the version is frozen and the setup is present, the
58	// read must fail as encoding corruption — never continue against that
59	// circuit — and a legal job sharing the file must not produce a partial
60	// result.
