113	// The same collision with a compiled artifact: the damaged job is bound to a
114	// compiled_hash, and the real "电路�" version carries exactly that artifact.
115	// The encoding refusal must still come first — the job may not read as bound
116	// to the other circuit's compiled artifact, and the message must not be a
117	// hash mismatch.
